        <h2 id="how-to-book">How to book</h2>

        <p>
          The shortest path is <a href={wa} data-cta="blog_body" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a> or a call to <a href={telHref} data-cta="blog_body" data-call-inline>{business.phoneDisplay}</a>. Tell us the car, the dates, and the Miami Beach or South Beach property. We confirm the car and the handover point, then send the quote. Hours are {hoursPhrase}.
        </p>

        <p>
          Live rates for the Urus, the Maybach GLS 600, and the Mercedes-Benz S580 are on each car page and collected on the <a href="/pricing">pricing page</a>. Multi-day stays follow the ladder published there: each car has its own {numWord(discountTiers[0].days)}-day rate, with deeper reductions as the booking gets longer. Read the number on the page for the dates you actually want rather than carrying a one-day figure through a five-day stay.
        </p>

        <BlogPhoto
          srcKey="/gallery/mercedes-maybach-gls-600-lamborghini-urus-rental-miami-metromover.jpg"
          width={1200}
          height={800}
          caption="Mercedes-Maybach GLS 600 and Lamborghini Urus parked under the Metromover track in downtown Miami."
        />

        <p>What you will need is ordinary, and we would rather list it than surprise anyone at the valet stand:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>Minimum age is {minimumAge}, with a valid driver's license. The age rule, and the one car that is an exception, is explained in <a href="/blog/how-old-do-you-have-to-be-to-rent-an-exotic-car-in-miami">how old you have to be to rent an exotic car in Miami</a>.</li>
          <li>Renters must carry insurance that covers the rental vehicle. If you do not have qualifying coverage, we can sell a daily policy at booking. The published figures and the cases they cover are in <a href="/blog/no-insurance-rentals-miami">no insurance rentals Miami</a>.</li>
          <li>A refundable security deposit is held and released after the car is inspected on return. The amount, and the one car that differs, is on the pricing and terms pages.</li>
          <li>Mileage is included and pooled across the rental rather than capped each day. The daily inclusion and the overage rate are on the pricing page.</li>
          <li>Delivery and collection are charged separately and confirmed in the quote. Delivery to Miami Beach and South Beach hotels is charged each way at the published Miami rate. Fort Lauderdale is a different fee, also published.</li>
          <li>Cancellations made within {numWord(cancellation.noRefundWithinDays)} days of the rental start date are non-refundable.</li>
        </ul>

        <BlogPhoto
          srcKey="/gallery/lamborghini-urus-rental-miami-quilted-interior.jpg"
          width={960}
          height={1280}
          caption="Quilted leather front seats and panoramic roof of the Lamborghini Urus."
