        <p>
          If you are still deciding, send the itinerary rather than a car name. A preview-day schedule that is mostly the Convention Center and a Mid-Beach hotel is a different car from a week that also includes Wynwood openings and a Saturday night on Ocean Drive. We will tell you which of the three we would put you in, including when that is the Mercedes-Benz S580.
        </p>

